{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_020meg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_020meg01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "916318782d2025ade6742a3bdc0c616934cd47280409b1ffc495e395f05056b4", "ja": "（今日は恵美と、地元のテレビ番組ロケ。\n1日がかりで、長崎の主な観光地を紹介した……）", "zh": "（今天和惠美一起参加本地电视节目的外景拍摄。历时1天，介绍了长崎的主要观光景点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_020meg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_020meg01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1924d335a8e858d4bfe2fbf235a3b01c82abb3e0bf28e08d5c0aab80755d4623", "ja": "恵美、長時間お疲れさま。予定よりもロケが長く\nなっちゃったし、今日はゆっくり休んでくれ。", "zh": "惠美，录了这么久辛苦了。外景拍摄比预定时间\n拖得长了些，今天就好好休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_020meg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_020meg01_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "feba67ef27a961f4ca82fa3a478eaacd6ec785a6e759f787b35071722e4b8ceb", "ja": "{$P$}もお疲れ～。\nアタシもクタクタだけど、楽しかったよ！", "zh": "{$P$}也辛苦啦～。\n虽然我也累坏了，不过挺开心的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_020meg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_020meg01_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "05da8d367184dc687d8e83d39f1e8bb19bf0e5e1a847c83160c4719719fd8043", "ja": "観光地にいっぱい行けて、旅行みたいだったし。\nこんな贅沢な仕事、なかなかないよね～。", "zh": "去了好多景点，感觉就像去旅行一样。\n这么奢侈的工作，真的不多见呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_020meg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_020meg01_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "99f9ab4853d80528a73677e5d81f7605c794436037ceac9e5c40f01d245462ae", "ja": "ディレクターさんも、「撮れ高がいいから、このまま\n2週分にしちゃおう！」って盛り上がってくれてさ♪", "zh": "导演也兴奋地说：“素材这么丰富，就照这样做成2周的内容吧！”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_020meg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_020meg01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3953abd189c19a111fbd4d1330a2a7c498e4a6220b5736a6c184e03ba45ba82b", "ja": "そうだな、いい仕事ができたと思う！\n恵美にこの仕事をやってもらって、正解だったよ。", "zh": "是啊，我觉得这次工作完成得很棒！\n让惠美来做这份工作，果然是正确的选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_020meg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_020meg01_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "4e3d08024f139434a9e04c20dafba10ef907350fca777f0229fffac5cf107c94", "ja": "そこまでほめてもらうと、なんか照れるけど……\nにゃはは♪", "zh": "被你这么夸，我都有点不好意思了……\n呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_020meg01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_020meg01_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "dbb7dc69ba7c06c7e73b734937fbd4b6d8f1a80a9c19266549b452a0bb4d0608", "ja": "あ、せっかくだから、もうちょっと観光してく？\nアタシが{$P$}を、案内したげるよ！", "zh": "啊，难得来一趟，要不要再逛逛？\n我来给{$P$}带路吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
